---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/nav/Breadcrumb.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'May 30, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | MazePuzzles.io"
  description="Learn how MazePuzzles.io handles browser storage, cookies, analytics, advertising, and information related to playing, generating, and printing mazes."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">

    <Breadcrumb crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="mt-6 mb-10">
      <p
        class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-3"
        style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; color: var(--color-charcoal);"
      >Privacy</p>
      <h1
        class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl uppercase leading-none mb-4"
        style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
      >Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-2" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
        This Privacy Policy explains how MazePuzzles.io handles information when you use the site.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-2" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
        MazePuzzles.io does not require an account to play, generate, or print mazes.
      </p>
      <p
        class="text-sm mt-3"
        style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; color: var(--color-muted-strong);"
      >Effective date: {effectiveDate}</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sections -->
    <div
      class="border-t space-y-10 pt-8"
      style="border-color: var(--color-border);"
    >

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-info-provide">
        <h2
          id="pp-info-provide"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >1. Information you provide</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          MazePuzzles.io currently does not require users to create accounts. If you contact us
          directly in the future, we may receive the information you choose to send, such as your
          email address and message.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-device-storage">
        <h2
          id="pp-device-storage"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >2. Information stored on your device</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          Some MazePuzzles.io features save progress, streaks, or preferences in your browser
          using local storage or similar browser storage. This helps the site remember maze progress
          on the same device. If you clear your browser data, this saved progress may be removed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-auto-collected">
        <h2
          id="pp-auto-collected"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >3. Automatically collected information</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          Like most websites, MazePuzzles.io may receive basic technical information such as
          browser type, device type, pages visited, approximate usage information, and error or
          security information through hosting, analytics, or security tools. This information
          helps operate and improve the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-cookies-ads">
        <h2
          id="pp-cookies-ads"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >4. Cookies and advertising</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          MazePuzzles.io may use cookies or similar technologies for site functionality, analytics,
          and advertising. If ads are shown, third-party advertising partners may use cookies or
          similar technologies to show, personalize, and measure ads. You can control cookies
          through your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-how-used">
        <h2
          id="pp-how-used"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >5. How information is used</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-3" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          Information may be used to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-base" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          <li>operate and improve the site</li>
          <li>save local progress, streaks, and preferences</li>
          <li>understand general site usage</li>
          <li>prevent abuse or technical issues</li>
          <li>respond to messages if a contact method exists</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-how-shared">
        <h2
          id="pp-how-shared"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >6. How information is shared</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          MazePuzzles.io does not sell user accounts because accounts are not required. Information
          may be processed by service providers that help host, operate, analyze, secure, or monetize
          the site. These providers process information according to their own terms and privacy practices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-children">
        <h2
          id="pp-children"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >7. Children and classrooms</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          MazePuzzles.io is designed to be usable by families, teachers, and students. The site does
          not require children to create accounts. Parents, guardians, and teachers should supervise
          internet use as appropriate.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-your-choices">
        <h2
          id="pp-your-choices"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >8. Your choices</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-3" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          You can:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-base" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          <li>use the site without creating an account</li>
          <li>clear browser storage to remove locally saved progress, streaks, and preferences</li>
          <li>adjust browser cookie settings</li>
          <li>contact us if a contact method is provided</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-changes">
        <h2
          id="pp-changes"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >9. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will be posted
          on this page with a new effective date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="pp-contact">
        <h2
          id="pp-contact"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >10. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          Contact information will be added when a support address is selected.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
